 the Babilim service: what failed, where and when, a random report ID, the versions and the site language. Only the error, where it happened and the versions are published as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.','Translation edits'=>'Translation edits','Share my edits with Babilim'=>'Share my edits with Babilim','When you change a translation that came from Babilim, your version is sent with the original text, Babilim\'s translation, the plugin or theme, the language and the build. Babilim processes it with AI models and may use it to improve that translation for every site. Off by default.'=>'When you change a translation that came from Babilim, your version is sent with the original text, Babilim\'s translation, the plugin or theme, the language and the build. Babilim processes it with AI models and may use it to improve that translation for every site. Off by default.','Your own translations'=>'Your own translations','Keep my translations when removing everything or uninstalling Babilim.'=>'Keep my translations when removing everything or uninstalling Babilim.','Your edits and the files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. Unchecking this deletes them when you remove everything or uninstall.'=>'Your edits and the files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. Unchecking this deletes them when you remove everything or uninstall.','Files: %s.'=>'Files: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'Imported: %s.','Already identical: %s.'=>'Already identical: %s.','Kept your existing translation: %s.'=>'Kept your existing translation: %s.','Imported, but no longer used in this version: %s.'=>'Imported, but no longer used in this version: %s.','Kept as drafts to fix: %s.'=>'Kept as drafts to fix: %s.','Skipped: %s.'=>'Skipped: %s.','Review the import'=>'Review the import','Loco Translate\'s files are not changed. Deactivate Loco Translate yourself when you are ready.'=>'Loco Translate\'s files 